'''Brainwashed Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules]], [[June Bride (Gacha Event)|June Bride]] and [[Ultra 4 Selection (Gacha Event)|Ultra 4 Selection]] events. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] increases health, gives [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] targeting, and immunity to [[Curse]].

